       phase, ahead of the copy, and `entryDriver.ts` writes its opacity, transform, blur
       and scan line every frame. No transition, deliberately — a transition would chase
       each of those frames instead of landing on it. */
    .has-js [data-console] {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }
}

/* ── Reveals ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
